// An arcane bolt in flight (kit/effects.rs; spell.rs sweeps the trail's strip along each
// bolt's path, lights it with the bolt's own two lights and draws its head): the head a
// white-hot core in a soft blue halo (the flash, drawn out along the flight on screen), the
// trail a streak, as Path of Exile's and Diablo IV's projectiles are drawn: a thin white-hot
// line down its middle in a narrow blue halo narrowing down the trail, the tail eroded into
// wisps, no border. iso-kit j43 replaced the head's hard ellipsoid and halo card (the judges'
// "hard crescent sprites") and narrowed the halo (rim 800 -> 480 nits, its Gaussian 3 -> 7).
// At the ruin's ev100 8 (exposure 1/307) the line is ~11 linear, the halo ~1.6 in blue.
(
    cue: Bolt,
    at: Hero,
    still: 0.0,
    life: 0.5,
    flash: (core: Srgb(0.88, 0.94, 1.0), core_nits: 4500.0, rim: Srgb(0.3, 0.55, 1.0), rim_nits: 260.0,
        size: 0.5, core_size: 0.1, falloff: 6.0, swell: 0.0, fall: 1.0),
    trail: (core: Srgb(0.85, 0.92, 1.0), core_nits: 3500.0, rim: Srgb(0.3, 0.55, 1.0), rim_nits: 480.0,
        width: 0.1, smear: 1.0, tail: 1.3, soft: 0.2, streak: true),
)
